{
    "word": "agitprop",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                "word": "agitprop",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "7cd276cd-66b2-4932-94e2-28ae14bc733d",
                        "entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "agitprops"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fa04f81-e0ad-3aaa-8b75-142e4c649749",
                        "entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Political propaganda disseminated through art, drama, literature, etc., especially communist propaganda; (specifically, communism, historical) such propaganda formerly disseminated by the Department for Agitation and Propaganda of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "also",
                            "attributive",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "405c29f3-d39c-4745-8ad8-f34079cd6554",
                                "sense_id": "9fa04f81-e0ad-3aaa-8b75-142e4c649749",
                                "text": "Russian Twitter and Facebook bots trolled both the left and the right with agitprop — in what appears to have been a general effort to deepen divisions and sow political chaos in America, not to favor one party or candidate over the other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a2d0422-b893-44de-9c1e-85f95c45d776",
                                "sense_id": "9fa04f81-e0ad-3aaa-8b75-142e4c649749",
                                "text": "The letter was pure puffery, probably written by some clerk in North Korea's agitprop bureau, but [Donald] Trump loved it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aab93535-db63-454c-8608-3dc9c637ef4b",
                                "sense_id": "9fa04f81-e0ad-3aaa-8b75-142e4c649749",
                                "text": "Like most pieces of agitprop, the Lucas and Sargent paper vastly overstated the deficiencies of the old order."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "82dc5336-1468-36d4-ba92-f2f3e67ab482",
                        "entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An instance of such propaganda."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d7ed135e-1931-3eb8-93b3-b81b3cc51b09",
                        "entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An organization or person engaged in disseminating such propaganda."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77142246-8c3d-40bc-9821-9bdd3f0aa1f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "source_sense_description": "political propaganda disseminated through art, etc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "agitprop",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "agitprop",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b919c0e9-d918-3a37-8e80-44adbe28ae3d",
                                        "entry_id": "91b4dda1-736d-325c-8615-a6ccb109d295",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propagande politique de masse, émotionnelle et provocante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8e3cab3-3df0-4847-b080-46387d75d1fd",
                                                "sense_id": "b919c0e9-d918-3a37-8e80-44adbe28ae3d",
                                                "text": "C'est pourquoi l'Eta, soviétique, qui a une idéologie officielle à défendre, a banni la recherche sociale et l'a remplacée par l’agitprop. Tandis que le but de la recherche est de vérifier une théorie sociale par l'observation de la réalité, le but de l’agitprop est de faire en sorte que la réalité apparaisse conforme à l'idéologie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c0f37bd-6a0a-4419-ab8d-50e41d33b335",
                                                "sense_id": "b919c0e9-d918-3a37-8e80-44adbe28ae3d",
                                                "text": "L’agitprop (agitation et propagande) fut initialement organisé par la Direction politique du Conseil militaire révolutionnaire, autrement dit de l'Armée, qui déploya des efforts systématiques durant la guerre civile, notamment dans le domaine de l'affiche."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "883aa7b9-f4ec-486c-874e-c5ab2ca0910e",
                                                "sense_id": "b919c0e9-d918-3a37-8e80-44adbe28ae3d",
                                                "text": "Le reste n’est qu’agitprop de fachos rouges, bruns ou verts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d5c31943-f8aa-4126-adc3-98e39b496a05",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "source_sense_description": "political propaganda disseminated through art, etc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "Agitprop",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea24f04a-f37f-49d2-9c53-b922e1eb1c0c",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "source_sense_description": "political propaganda disseminated through art, etc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "agit-prop",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "78d0431f-f6d2-4a9a-80a0-70e5a963d439",
                        "source_entry_id": "8c888b58-e9ef-374d-b341-2b224f738bf3",
                        "source_sense_description": "political propaganda disseminated through art, etc.",
                        "target_lang_word": "агитпро́п",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "агитпро́п",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc83e875-9741-3d9c-bbfd-77f270afaae9",
                                        "entry_id": "4e20211a-9edc-345e-b0d6-893fbd824e8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "агитация и пропаганда"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34b0ed19-4166-4357-a43c-abb7f7918ede",
                                                "sense_id": "fc83e875-9741-3d9c-bbfd-77f270afaae9",
                                                "text": "Наш агитпроп тщательно оберегает население от буржуазной политической литературы, боясь её воздействия на умы людей."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44e2e84a-fc5b-3934-879f-842c0a822b44",
                                        "entry_id": "4e20211a-9edc-345e-b0d6-893fbd824e8b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "истор. в СССР до 1934 года — отдел агитации и пропаганды при ЦК, а также при местных комитетах ВКП(б)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "465d3bdf-ff68-4836-a5af-a1a14c9297ea",
                                                "sense_id": "44e2e84a-fc5b-3934-879f-842c0a822b44",
                                                "text": "Нам казалось бы целесообразным, чтобы такая литература была попутно использована агитпропом Ленинградского Губкома, как иллюстративный материал для докладов по вопросам истории нашей первой революции."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "агитпро́п",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "234daa85-6c83-3d4e-b567-a61a09eba9dd",
                                        "entry_id": "6997d0f6-3554-3bae-96a7-0b571a2c6c57",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "советск., разг. заведующий отделом агитации и пропаганды при местном комитете ВКП(б); ответственный за агитацию и пропаганду"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef67dff9-3f1b-451c-896a-df77f41e7818",
                                                "sense_id": "234daa85-6c83-3d4e-b567-a61a09eba9dd",
                                                "text": "С ним пришла Женя Смирнова, агитпроп райкома, плотная и румяная, в выгоревшей косоворотке и красной косынке, через плечо портупея."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8df01b80-1f91-30e4-8e93-c5ea9c81379e",
                                        "entry_id": "6997d0f6-3554-3bae-96a7-0b571a2c6c57",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "советск., разг. агитатор-пропагандист"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de980178-b08d-4ea8-93da-fd002174c4f4",
                                                "sense_id": "8df01b80-1f91-30e4-8e93-c5ea9c81379e",
                                                "text": "— Доклад не сделает и в агитпропы не годится, но если дать ему пулемёт, — сдохнет, а пулемёта не бросит."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
