                        ],
                        "form": "agitprops"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e35b7263-657f-44d9-91c6-148157e1d152",
                        "entry_id": "37885c76-79de-3b3e-8e21-34ad49ace21f",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "present"
                        ],
                        "form": "agitpropping"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b3faa03a-b353-4e54-bf86-b7bc008f54cf",
                        "entry_id": "37885c76-79de-3b3e-8e21-34ad49ace21f",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "agitpropped"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b40c3f6e-0c39-42c4-ad53-1b78fa084287",
                        "entry_id": "37885c76-79de-3b3e-8e21-34ad49ace21f",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "agitpropped"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                        "entry_id": "37885c76-79de-3b3e-8e21-34ad49ace21f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To disseminate (something as) political propaganda, especially communist propaganda, through art, drama, literature, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ambitransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d96833c-e271-4b31-ba5a-3fc990d72293",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "Anyone who has seen a class struggler at work, agitpropping around Union Square, or the back streets of the Loop, realizes that, by the very nature of things, he or she is so possessed of that particular barricading dream as to lose touch with all reality, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "31c70ddb-dad5-45be-b17e-d639ab6124af",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "With respect to a poet's facility in logomachy, boredom in the area of power politics theorisation, the seriousness or gaiety with which he agitprops his ego, the degree of his attitude toward the superior poet, or the rebelliousness or conformity of his disciples?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0f35a6f-8817-43bc-a037-3868d58a66a1",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "This is to suggest that the university will leave behind its more limited work and bourgeois integrity in order to undertake the task of brain-trusting and agitpropping for the revolution."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b3da46c-f11d-4777-8886-6b4f176bd131",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "Envoys and missionaries agitpropped in the four corners of the Empire, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f10be61-ac32-4acf-af11-c8f9e1d4edc5",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "More an insecure platform for Mr. [Mbongeni] Ngema's didacticism than a play with a life of its own, \"Township Fever\" is agit-propped with polemical sloganeering."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5a9df83-d4b2-4be7-a81b-baa32b0c25ca",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "The double agent was Grant Bristow, who agit-propped for—not against—the right-wing Heritage Front and is now hiding in a safe house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6902555-652e-44f2-b501-3c0151c4ebfe",
                                "sense_id": "6c093e52-b15b-3d77-a035-93736f8b0ba6",
                                "text": "I knew that he [Allen Van Newkirk] agitpropped other poetry readings and media events, e.g. the Underground Press Syndicate conference in Madison (shouting, \"All media are lies\")."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
